Upgrade certifi in the requirements of `@rules_python//tools/publish:twine`,
the default `twine_binary` of `py_wheel`, to a release that no longer trusts
the compromised eMudhra (emSign) CA. This is also what the `pip` extension
records in `MODULE.bazel.lock`.
See https://github.com/bazel-contrib/rules_python/issues/4299 and
https://github.com/bazel-contrib/rules_python/pull/4297.

